   "source": [
    "# Family Model - Deep Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook showcases our pipeline in action, for the \"family\" label classification task. This is our deepest model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4cf64995",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Imports\n",
    "\n",
    "The imports are composed of a mix of third-party libraries and several modules and constants that we have custom built to fit our needs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
