    "# Slice upsample with the selected indices \n",
    "aux_df = upsampled[upsampled['rare_species_id'].isin(train_df['rare_species_id'])]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Update the metadata with the selected upsample indices\n",
    "train_df = pd.concat([train_df,aux_df], ignore_index=True, axis=0)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Looks good\n",
    "train_df"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6fe0b4f0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Image Generator\n",
    "\n",
    "Image generator is setup with conservative values, as animal features like faces are not invariant under rotation. Test images were standardized according to the IMAGENET standard."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "89dc8104",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Image Generator\n",
    "train_datagen = ImageDataGenerator(\n",
    "        rotation_range=90,\n",
    "        shear_range=0.2,\n",
    "        brightness_range=[0.8, 1.2],\n",
    "        horizontal_flip=True,\n",
    "        channel_shift_range=30.0,\n",
    "        zoom_range=(0.8, 1.2),\n",
    "        fill_mode='nearest',\n",
    "        preprocessing_function=lambda image: smart_resize(image, size=MODEL_IMAGE_SIZE['efficientnetb4'])\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "test_datagen = ImageDataGenerator(\n",
    "        preprocessing_function=lambda image: smart_resize(image, size=MODEL_IMAGE_SIZE['efficientnetb4'])\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9bca34a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Note: we were unable to debug the issue shown above with 232 images, however it was deemed to not be a source of data leakage, as far as we can diagnose it. .**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7307bb99",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Flow_from\n",
    "\n",
    "Flow from dataframe along side each generator setup for each of the data splits."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "8ca63c65",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Found 17304 validated image filenames belonging to 202 classes.\n",
      "Found 1438 validated image filenames belonging to 202 classes.\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "c:\\Users\\Admin\\anaconda\\envs\\test\\Lib\\site-packages\\keras\\src\\legacy\\preprocessing\\image.py:920: UserWarning: Found 230 invalid image filename(s) in x_col=\"file_path\". These filename(s) will be ignored.\n",
      "  warnings.warn(\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Found 2397 validated image filenames belonging to 202 classes.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Train generator\n",
    "train_generator = train_datagen.flow_from_dataframe(\n",
    "    dataframe=train_df,\n",
    "    directory=INPUT_DIR,\n",
    "    x_col='file_path',\n",
    "    y_col='family',\n",
    "    target_size=MODEL_IMAGE_SIZE['efficientnetb4'],\n",
    "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
    "    class_mode='categorical',\n",
    "    seed=SEEDS[0],\n",
    "    shuffle=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Validation generator\n",
    "val_generator = test_datagen.flow_from_dataframe(\n",
    "    dataframe=val_df,\n",
    "    directory=INPUT_DIR,\n",
    "    x_col='file_path',\n",
    "    y_col='family',\n",
    "    target_size=MODEL_IMAGE_SIZE['efficientnetb4'],\n",
    "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
    "    class_mode='categorical',\n",
    "    shuffle=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Test generator\n",
    "test_generator = test_datagen.flow_from_dataframe(\n",
    "    dataframe=test_df,\n",
    "    directory=INPUT_DIR,\n",
    "    x_col='file_path',\n",
    "    y_col='family',\n",
    "    target_size=MODEL_IMAGE_SIZE['efficientnetb4'],\n",
    "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
    "    class_mode='categorical',\n",
    "    shuffle=False\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4bc6b58f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Weights\n",
    "\n",
    "Our loss function of choice was the MultiClass Focal Loss, a derivation of the Focal Loss."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "e57d9305",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Map class weights from labels - indices using the generator\n",
    "label_map = train_generator.class_indices\n",
    "weights_str = compute_effective_class_weights(train_df, 'family')\n",
    "weights_idx = {label_map[k]: v for k, v in weights_str.items()}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Convert to list for alpha\n",
    "alpha = [weights_idx[i] for i in range(len(weights_idx))]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Instantiate focal loss\n",
    "loss = CategoricalFocalLoss(gamma=5, alpha=alpha)\n",
    "\n",
    "num_classes = train_df['family'].nunique()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "72aecc70",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Model Instanciation and Compilation\n",
    "\n",
    "Our model is then instanced, and compiled, RMSprop was found to be a stable option."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "6115eb72",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "WARNING:tensorflow:From c:\\Users\\Admin\\anaconda\\envs\\test\\Lib\\site-packages\\keras\\src\\backend\\tensorflow\\core.py:219: The name tf.placeholder is deprecated. Please use tf.compat.v1.placeholder instead.\n",
      "\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Get the model and its configuration\n",
    "model, config = efficient_net_deep(\n",
    "    num_classes=num_classes,\n",
    "    regularizer=False,\n",
    "    dropout=True,\n",
    "    task_type='multiclass'\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Now compile the model\n",
    "model.compile(\n",
    "    optimizer=RMSprop(learning_rate=0.001),\n",
    "    loss=loss,  # CategoricalFocalLoss\n",
    "    metrics=['accuracy', AUC(multi_label=False), 'precision', 'recall']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
